===============================================================
 Layouts refused although they are nobody's linked worktree
 git 2.43.0, node v24.18.1
===============================================================

=== A. git init --separate-git-dir (named in the goal description) ===

$ cat separate/.git
  gitdir: /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/elsewhere.git
$ git -C separate rev-parse --git-dir --git-common-dir --show-toplevel
  /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/elsewhere.git
  /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/elsewhere.git
  /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/separate
  ^ git-dir equals git-common-dir, so this checkout IS the main worktree.
$ git -C separate worktree list --porcelain | head -1
  worktree /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/elsewhere.git
  ^ but the listing names the Git directory, not the checkout.

base commit e8d90f3   $ stepstone project add "Plan the next release"
Added project goal plan-the-next-release: Plan the next release
[exit 0]

target commit e1dd6d4 $ stepstone project add "Plan the next release"
Project worklist /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/separate/.worklist/worklist.json cannot be changed from /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/separate: the repository at /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/elsewhere.git has no main worktree, so no checkout of it is the roadmap's sole writer. Restore the main worktree if it was removed, or make this change in a clone that has one; a store outside the committed roadmap paths, named by $STEPSTONE_WORKLIST, stays writable here.
[exit 1]

=== B. a Git submodule working tree ===

$ cat parent/sub/.git
  gitdir: ../.git/modules/sub
$ git -C parent/sub rev-parse --git-dir --git-common-dir --show-toplevel
  /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/.git/modules/sub
  /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/.git/modules/sub
  /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/sub
  ^ the submodule is the only worktree of its own repository.
$ git -C parent/sub worktree list --porcelain | head -1
  worktree /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/.git/modules/sub

base commit e8d90f3   $ stepstone project add "Plan the next release"
Added project goal plan-the-next-release: Plan the next release
[exit 0]

