Project worklist /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/sub/.worklist/worklist.json cannot be changed from /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/sub: the repository at /tmp/stepstone-e2e-scratch/defect/parent/.git/modules/sub has no main worktree, so no checkout of it is the roadmap's sole writer. Restore the main worktree if it was removed, or make this change in a clone that has one; a store outside the committed roadmap paths, named by $STEPSTONE_WORKLIST, stays writable here.
